Error: daemon executable not found at [CODEX_HOME]/packages/app-server-daemon/current/bin/codex; repair the existing installation, or run `corbanu app-server daemon start` from a Corbanu Terminal installation to install a missing daemon

Install or update Corbanu Terminal itself using the instructions at https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal#install.
To work without the background server, rerun the same command with --no-daemon (including resume or fork and its arguments).
